Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Sensei! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mano, hurry. You have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Mano. No matter what happens, stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mano. It's dangerous here.
